### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@productId = 1

### 1. Health Check (Root)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Listar todos los productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 3. Obtener un producto específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### 4. Crear un nuevo producto
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Gaming ASUS ROG",
  "description": "Laptop de alto rendimiento con RTX 4070, ideal para gaming y trabajo profesional",
  "price": 1599.99,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "Computadoras",
  "brand": "ASUS",
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603302576837-37561b2e2302?w=500",
  "slug": "laptop-gaming-asus-rog",
  "keywords": ["laptop", "gaming", "asus", "rog", "rtx", "computadora"]
}

### 5. Actualizar un producto
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1499.99,
  "stock": 12
}

### 6. Generar embedding de imagen desde URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/generate-image-embedding-from-url

### 7. Generar embedding de texto
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/generate-text-embedding

### 8. Generar embedding de imagen desde base64
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/generate-image-embedding
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
  "mime_type": "image/png"
}

### 9. Buscar productos similares por imagen
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/search-by-image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
  "mime_type": "image/png",
  "limit": 5
}

### 10. Generar embeddings en lote para todos los productos
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/batch-generate-embeddings

### 11. Eliminar un producto (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
